"0749c","t":"不生破想行四邊見生有四十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0750a01","n":"0750a","t":"入十八界一切諸法總破八倒"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0750b01","n":"0750b","t":"思俱斷也五薄地者體愛假即"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0750c01","n":"0750c","t":"心度一切眾生是菩薩欲度眾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0751a01","n":"0751a","t":"二觀淳熟雙照二諦入菩薩地"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0751b01","n":"0751b","t":"教大乘別為菩薩立名位也二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0751c01","n":"0751c","t":"四地也若斷別惑不共二乘如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0752a01","n":"0752a","t":"以不空聲聞辟支佛但見於空"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0752b01","n":"0752b","t":"上日今明別教大乘次位須用"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0752c01","n":"0752c","t":"行四者十迴向五者十地六者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0753a01","n":"0753a","t":"觀入十地也欲以一切種智斷"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0753b01","n":"0753b","t":"當願樂割愛修道即是信心所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0753c01","n":"0753c","t":"薩行者即是受持讀誦大乘方"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0754a01","n":"0754a","t":"是觀時眉間則出青黃赤白鴿"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0754b01","n":"0754b","t":"遍也五知通塞者即是知四種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0754c01","n":"0754c","t":"那含佛子四阿羅漢佛子五辟"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0755a01","n":"0755a","t":"諦分別諸界有無量相悉是諸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0755b01","n":"0755b","t":"云一實諦者名為真法若法非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0755c01","n":"0755c","t":"四教義卷第九四教義卷第十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0756a01","n":"0756a","t":"五三昧破二十五有顯二十五"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0756b01","n":"0756b","t":"諸垢故修前根本戒破惡業垢"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0756c01","n":"0756c","t":"破慳惡業苦修定伏見思苦修"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0757a01","n":"0757a","t":"見思闇故一切智日光三昧成"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0757b01","n":"0757b","t":"修俗諦三昧幻出道種智破無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0757c01","n":"0757c","t":"其青有義推可知次黃色三昧"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0758a01","n":"0758a","t":"續不斷即無常菩薩為破此無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0758b01","n":"0758b","t":"王悉入其中是故一切眾生受"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0758c01","n":"0758c","t":"薩雖入初地初地不應住以有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0759a01","n":"0759a","t":"逆非涅槃故無小乘心又云楊"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0759b01","n":"0759b","t":"入於八難不得無難意在此也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0759c01","n":"0759c","t":"玄門若望法雲名之為佛望妙"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0760a01","n":"0760a","t":"歡喜地即用佛菩提智斷初品"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0760b01","n":"0760b","t":"以今明圓教次位正約非空非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0760c01","n":"0760c","t":"並等覺之位明此義也大涅槃"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0761a01","n":"0761a","t":"斷而涅槃云闇時無明明時無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0761b01","n":"0761b","t":"圓教初頓至十住即是十地而"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0761c01","n":"0761c","t":"身即是實相即是中道第一義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0762a01","n":"0762a","t":"諦令安道諦也知生死即涅槃"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0762b01","n":"0762b","t":"為名字即因此觀行分明成五"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0762c01","n":"0762c","t":"槃知煩惱即菩提故能巧修此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0763a01","n":"0763a","t":"四類明九住一正釋初發心住"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0763b01","n":"0763b","t":"發心住名義不同者華嚴經云"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0763c01","n":"0763c","t":"其中冥益眾生八番破二十五"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0764a01","n":"0764a","t":"品智斷故名十迴向也五明十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0764b01","n":"0764b","t":"若光明漸漸滅盡譬十五斷德"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0764c01","n":"0764c","t":"十地及等覺地皆言佛知見者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0765a01","n":"0765a","t":"圓別通三教顯在大品經文也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0765b01","n":"0765b","t":"門二乘尚不聞其名豈有凡夫"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0765c01","n":"0765c","t":"薩皆稱不任問疾者正以圓破"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0766a01","n":"0766a","t":"訶般若但明通別圓三教之位"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0766b01","n":"0766b","t":"說三教即是權也而說圓教即"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0766c01","n":"0766c","t":"議之妙用此為劣也故華嚴經"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0767a01","n":"0767a","t":"便應緣謝便息空拳誑小兒引"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0767b01","n":"0767b","t":"真解已發是則四緣俱息則三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0767c01","n":"0767c","t":"證妙覺無師自悟無法可歎無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0768a01","n":"0768a","t":"略說名毘曇心達磨波羅處中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0768b01","n":"0768b","t":"二對論者論有二種一者通申"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0768c01","n":"0768c","t":"有異如前分別二用四教釋此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1929_p0769a01","n":"0769a","t":"國也亦用此成無動如來佛國"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T46n1929-四教義","source":"CBETA T46n1929 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":145,"unit":"T46 頁欄"}